.DS_Store
snapshots/
verify_findings.py

# Local topology artifacts. topology.yaml itself is tracked (the tests read it),
# but a deployment customises it in place, and `git add -A` has twice swept that
# customisation into a commit — where it breaks every test that asserts the
# stock topology has no auth block. The backups and the rendered SVG are pure
# local output and never belong in a commit.
topology.yaml.*bak*
topology.svg
